<section class="page-hero"><img class="bg" src="/assets/img/photos/roof-tarp.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-tarp-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-tarp.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="765" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.12"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span>Services</nav><span class="kicker light up">What we do</span><h1 class="up" style="animation-delay:.06s">Insurance Appraisal Services Across Wisconsin</h1><p class="lede up" style="animation-delay:.14s">From a single estimate review to full appraisal panel work and neutral umpire service, every Wisconsin Insurance Appraiser service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss.</p><div class="btn-row up" style="animation-delay:.22s"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ghost-l" href="/contact-us/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="index-grid" data-stagger><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/appraisal-demand-representation/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="130px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 01</span><h2>Appraisal Demand Representation</h2><p>Once appraisal is demanded, we serve as the appraiser you appoint and carry your side of the valuation to the finish.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/home-insurance-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/family-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/family-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/family-home.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="684" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 02</span><h2>Home Insurance Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for single-family homes, duplexes and Polish flats, condo units, and lake cottages or cabins across the state.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/apartments.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/apartments-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/apartments.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 03</span><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for commercial buildings, apartment properties, condo associations and churches with large or complex losses.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/hail-roof-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-shingles.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 04</span><h2>Hail &amp; Roof Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for hail-damaged roofs, siding, gutters and windows when the carrier offers repairs instead of replacement.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/tornado-straight-line-wind-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 05</span><h2>Tornado &amp; Straight-Line Wind Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for tornado, derecho and straight-line wind losses, from torn shingles to structural damage and fallen trees.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/snow-load-roof-collapse-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 06</span><h2>Snow Load &amp; Roof Collapse Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for roof collapse, sagging trusses and structural damage caused by the weight of snow and ice.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/water-sewer-backup-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ceiling-water.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ceiling-water-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ceiling-water.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 07</span><h2>Water &amp; Sewer Backup Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for sudden water damage, burst supply lines and sewer or drain backup claims under your endorsement limits.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 08</span><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for fire, smoke and soot losses, including cleaning versus replacement disputes and contents.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/ice-dam-frozen-pipe-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="685" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 09</span><h2>Ice Dam &amp; Frozen Pipe Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for Wisconsin’s classic winter claims: ice dams, frozen and burst pipes, and deep-cold damage.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/farm-barn-outbuilding-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/red-barn.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/red-barn-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/red-barn.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 10</span><h2>Farm, Barn &amp; Outbuilding Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for dairy barns, machine sheds, pole buildings and silos insured under farm and ranch policies.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 1024w" sizes="130px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 11</span><h2>Carrier Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of the insurer’s estimate so you know what is missing before deciding on appraisal.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/umpire-selection-services/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting.webp 960w" sizes="130px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bd"><span class="k">Service 12</span><h2>Umpire Services &amp; Selection</h2><p>We serve as a neutral umpire on appraisal panels and help appraisers find a qualified, impartial umpire.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv-l"><span class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</span><h2>Most claims start with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and some disputes end there.</p><a class="btn" href="/appraisal-solutions/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv-r"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one step?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle farm and commercial claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes: houses, duplexes, condos, apartment buildings, retail and office space, churches, condo associations and farm buildings.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is it only storm claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. We also value water, sewer backup, fire, smoke, ice dam and frozen-pipe losses.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><div><h2>Claim paid, but not enough to fix it?</h2><p>Send us the insurer’s estimate and your photos. We’ll tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line" href="/contact-us/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
